{"id":"n91481-3-7","stage":1,"title":"잘못되다 · 遭遇不测","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91481-3-7-1","ko":"지수 씨가 잘못되면 나 혼자 어떻게 살아요?","zh":"如果智秀出事了，我一个人要怎么活下去啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀。","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}},{"text":"씨가","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨가","audio":"/audio/a79ea387c9969a8c754c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못되면","meaning":"遭遇不测，遭遇不幸，出事","explanation":"잘못되다：遭遇不测，遭遇不幸，出事；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"잘못되다","audio":"/audio/907b4e753781c8cdeb77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91481","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘못되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못되면","audio":"/audio/af13405827fdfdcd2104.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","